---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">About LUBASA Investments</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-700">
      LUBASA Investments and Company Limited is a Ugandan manufacturer and supplier of
      school chalk and stationery. Our flagship product, <strong>Extra Success Chalk</strong>,
      is available in white and a range of colours, and is trusted by schools for its
      smooth writing quality and durability.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-700">
      Alongside chalk, we supply exercise books (48, 96 and 192 pages), 3 and 4 quire
      counter books, notepads, artbooks and graphbooks — serving schools, offices and
      retailers with dependable quality and bulk supply.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-brand-700">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">To provide affordable, high-quality educational and office supplies that support learning and productivity.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-brand-700">Our Vision</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">To be a leading supplier of school and stationery products in Uganda and beyond.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-slate-500">More about our full product range and services is coming soon.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>